#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:2
msgid "Testing a spoonBot"
msgstr "测试 spoonBot"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:4
msgid ""
"The ``spoonBot_thumb.jpg`` image for this page was not preserved in the "
"archive."
msgstr "此页面的 ``spoonBot_thumb.jpg``\\ 图像未在存档中保留。"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:6
msgid ""
"spoonBot is a simple differential drive robot with a spoon connected to a "
"servo that allows it to pan and tilt. See the :doc:`spoonBot-Construction "
"<spoonbot>` page for information about building spoonBot. The sample program"
" that comes with the latest cc3 distribution contains sample code "
"demonstrating how to move spoonBot as well as run spoonBot Demo mode. "
"spoonBot Demo mode is similar to the CMUcam2 demo mode only it uses spoonBot"
" to pan and tilt."
msgstr ""
"spoonBot 是一个简单的差速驱动机器人，勺子连接到一个舵机，使其能够水平和垂直转动。有关构建 spoonBot 的信息，请参阅 "
":doc:`spoonBot-Construction <spoonbot>` 页面。最新 cc3 发行版随附的示例程序包含演示如何移动 "
"spoonBot 以及运行 spoonBot 演示模式的示例代码。spoonBot 演示模式类似于 CMUcam2 演示模式，只是它使用 "
"spoonBot 进行水平和垂直转动。"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:15
msgid "Calibrating spoonBot"
msgstr "校准 spoonBot"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:17
msgid ""
"Before using spoonBot, you need to calibrate your servo settings. This is "
"done by setting the following data structure at the top of main:"
msgstr "在使用 spoonBot 之前，您需要校准舵机设置。这是通过在 main 的顶部设置以下数据结构来完成的："

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:37
msgid "Flash the cmucam2 emulation firmware onto the camera"
msgstr "将 cmucam2 仿真固件刷写到相机上"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:38
msgid "Open either the CMUcam3 Frame Grabber or a Terminal Program"
msgstr "打开 CMUcam3 帧抓取器或终端程序"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:40
msgid ""
"Using the Frame Grabber, go to the \"Settings\" panel and drag the servo "
"bars to change values"
msgstr "使用帧抓取器，转到 \"Settings\" 面板并拖动舵机条以更改值"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:42
msgid ""
"In a terminal, type \"sv <servo-id> <servo-value>\" to set the servos for "
"example:"
msgstr "在终端中，键入 \"sv <servo-id> <servo-value>\" 来设置舵机，例如："

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:50
msgid ""
"Find the middle position of Servo's 0 and 1 by adjusting them until the "
"wheels stop"
msgstr "通过调整舵机 0 和 1 直到轮子停止，找到它们的中间位置"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:53
msgid "*my_cal.left_mid* = <value from servo 0>"
msgstr "*my_cal.left_mid* = <来自舵机 0 的值>"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:54
msgid "*my_cal.righ_mid* = <value from servo 1>"
msgstr "*my_cal.righ_mid* = <来自舵机 1 的值>"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:56
msgid "Now you need to find the sign of the directions"
msgstr "现在您需要找出方向的符号"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:58
msgid ""
"Looking at spoonBot from the back (spoon towards you) try lowering the servo"
" 0 number which should be the left wheel"
msgstr "从后面看 spoonBot（勺子朝向您），尝试降低舵机 0 的数值，它应该是左轮"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:61
msgid ""
"if the servo spins clockwise / backwards (toward you) then *left_dir* should"
" be set to 1"
msgstr "如果舵机顺时针/向后（朝向您）旋转，则应将 *left_dir* 设置为 1"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:63
msgid "if the servo spins counter clockwise, *left_dir* should be set to -1"
msgstr "如果舵机逆时针旋转，则应将 *left_dir* 设置为 -1"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:65
msgid ""
"Repeat for servo 1 (which should be the right wheel from spoonBot's point of"
" view)"
msgstr "对舵机 1 重复此操作（从 spoonBot 的视角看应该是右轮）"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:68
msgid ""
"if the servo spins clockwise / backwards (toward you) then *right_dir* "
"should be set to 1"
msgstr "如果舵机顺时针/向后（朝向您）旋转，则应将 *right_dir* 设置为 1"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:70
msgid "if the servo spins counter clockwise, *right_dir* should be set to -1"
msgstr "如果舵机逆时针旋转，则应将 *right_dir* 设置为 -1"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:72
msgid "Usually, one servo should be set to negative!"
msgstr "通常，应将一个舵机设置为负值！"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:74
msgid "Now find the Min, Middle and Max spoon positions by adjusting Servo 2"
msgstr "现在通过调整舵机 2 找到勺子的 Min、Middle 和 Max 位置"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:76
msgid ""
"Min should be the smallest value that pushes the spoon down and hence tilts "
"spoonBot forward"
msgstr "Min 应该是将勺子向下推，从而使 spoonBot 向前倾斜的最小值"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:79
msgid "Set *spoon_down* accordingly"
msgstr "相应地设置 *spoon_down*"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:81
msgid ""
"Max is usually 255 and should position spoonBot looking as far up as "
"possible"
msgstr "Max 通常为 255，应使 spoonBot 尽可能向上看"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:83
msgid "Set *spoon_up* accordingly"
msgstr "相应地设置 *spoon_up*"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:85
msgid "Middle is the value that makes the servo level"
msgstr "Middle 是使舵机保持水平的值"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:87
msgid "Set *spoon_mid* accordingly"
msgstr "相应地设置 *spoon_mid*"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:89
msgid "If Min and Max appear to be reversed, change *spoon_dir* to -1"
msgstr "如果 Min 和 Max 看起来颠倒了，请将 *spoon_dir* 更改为 -1"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:91
msgid ""
"Once the calibration is done, recompile the project and FLASH the CMUcam3. "
"spoonBot will first go through a sequence of scripted motions to make sure "
"the servos are setup correctly. Then spoonBot will wait for a button press "
"to begin tracking a color. Text is displayed over the serial port notifying "
"you of the various stages of operation."
msgstr ""
"校准完成后，重新编译项目并刷写 CMUcam3。spoonBot 将首先执行一系列脚本化的动作，以确保舵机设置正确。然后 spoonBot "
"将等待按钮按下以开始跟踪颜色。文本会通过串行端口显示，通知您各个操作阶段。"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:97
msgid "The scripted motion should be as follows:"
msgstr "脚本化的动作应如下："

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:99
msgid "Sit Still"
msgstr "静止不动"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:100
msgid "Look Down"
msgstr "向下看"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:101
msgid "Look Up"
msgstr "向上看"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:102
msgid "Back to Middle Position"
msgstr "回到中间位置"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:103
msgid "Rotate Clockwise (looking from above)"
msgstr "顺时针旋转（从上方看）"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:104
msgid "Rotate Counter-Clockwise"
msgstr "逆时针旋转"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:105
msgid "Red-Led off while camera gets ready"
msgstr "相机准备就绪时红色 LED 熄灭"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:106
msgid "Red-Led turns on when ready to track"
msgstr "准备好跟踪时红色 LED 亮起"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:108
msgid ""
"If this looks correct, then try holding a brightly colored object a few "
"inches in front of the camera and then press the button. As you pull the "
"object away, spoonBot should rotate towards it. Use brightly colored objects"
" that are as uniform in color as possible. An object like a bright red cloth"
" would work well since it reflects very little light (other than the pure "
"red). Make sure there is enough lighting in the room. Try grabbing a frame "
"to see what the conditions look like."
msgstr ""
"如果这看起来正确，那么尝试在相机前几英寸处拿着一个颜色鲜艳的物体，然后按下按钮。当您将物体移开时，spoonBot "
"应该会朝它转动。使用颜色尽可能均匀的鲜艳物体。像鲜红色的布这样的物体效果很好，因为它反射的光很少（除了纯红色）。确保房间里有足够的照明。尝试抓取一帧，看看条件是什么样的。"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot-demo.rst:116
msgid ""
"**Note: If you wish to disable servos without unplugging them, disconnect "
"the servo-power-jumper.**"
msgstr "**注意：如果您希望在不拔下舵机的情况下禁用它们，请断开舵机电源跳线。**"
